%% Billing — how what a plan gives follows the subscription. One derivation (Entitlements::State) for every way of paying.
flowchart TD
  A[Pay::Subscription changes\nstatus, period, ends_at, trial, pause] -->|after_commit| B[SyncEntitlementJob]
  C[Terms made by Start or Adopt] --> B
  D[One-time order paid / refunded] --> E[SyncOrderEntitlementJob]
  F[Plan grants edited] --> G[SyncPlanEntitlementsJob]
  B --> S{Entitlements::State}
  E --> S
  G --> S
  S -- trialing/active --> ACT[active: Reconcile applies what the plan includes]
  S -- past_due --> GR[grace: everything kept, holder warned]
  S -- unpaid, canceled, paused, ended --> L[lapsed: ReleaseAll takes away only what we made]
  S -- order refunded --> R[revoked: same]
  S -- incomplete --> P[pending: nothing yet]
  ACT --> N1[entitlement_granted notice]
  L --> N2[entitlement_lapsed notice]
  L -. paid again .-> ACT
  ACT --> Q[Quotas.sync_limit!: default + live allowances]
  L --> Q
